s her, huh...\" Upon realizing this, Wataru started keeping an appropriate distance towards her, much to Aika's surprise. \"Could it be that he hates me now...?\" Did his intentions slip by her because she was getting impatient after arriving at the wrong conclusion!? This is the start of a romcom revolving around two people who just can't get their feelings across and both think their love is unrequited!"],"ja":["夢見る男子は現実主義者",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-52013":"2024-04-02T12:36:18Z","serial-52440":"2023-09-25T14:53:10Z","serial-52268":"2023-09-22T16:34:14Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-52013","serial-52440","serial-52268"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":6.61,"availableEpisodeCount":12}]}